  "steps": [
    "Bring 400g water + broth powder to a boil. Whisk in polenta; reduce to medium-low; stir frequently 8\u201310 minutes.",
    "Add evaporated milk and laughing cow wedges; stir until creamy. Season with salt and pepper.",
    "Season chicken with garlic powder, smoked paprika, salt and pepper. Fry in oil 1 minute per side; finish in oven at 180\u00b0C / 350\u00b0F for 8\u201310 minutes.",
    "Slice chicken; serve over polenta."
